{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Every dawn, the kingdom rises and every dusk, it falls again. In Kingspath, you take the role of a weary king trying to rebuild his realm from the ashes. Each day brings new chances to grow stronger, but also new battles to survive.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138420/extras/25834f6e1f0124b3a71a6952076c456d.poster.avif?t=1773086120\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138420/extras/25834f6e1f0124b3a71a6952076c456d.webm?t=1773086120\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CITY BY DAY, BATTLE BY DUSK</strong><br>Build and expand your city, unlock new units, upgrade your defenses, and prepare for the chaos to come. When night falls, lead your army into the battlefield command your troops with simple but crucial orders like \u201cCharge!\u201d, \u201cFall back!\u201d, or \u201cHold the line!\u201d You control only your king. The rest of the army fights automatically, following your lead. Each decision shapes your legacy.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138420/extras/698eb96a7670de9269f24d96e7cf96c1.poster.avif?t=1773086120\" width=288 height=96 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138420/extras/698eb96a7670de9269f24d96e7cf96c1.webm?t=1773086120\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ROGUELIKE STRATEGY LOOP</strong>  <br>Kingspath combines base-building strategy with roguelike progression. Each campaign is unique: lose your battles, and you start again\u00a0 wiser, stronger, and slightly more suspicious of your archers.     </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138420/extras/a325e490e225c76f44f5c257b1444aaa.poster.avif?t=1773086120\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138420/extras/a325e490e225c76f44f5c257b1444aaa.webm?t=1773086120\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2699\ufe0f EARLY DEVELOPMENT</strong>\u00a0<strong>\u2699\ufe0f</strong> <br>Kingspath is currently in early development by a small indie team who love medieval chaos, and tactical disasters. Follow the journey, join the feedback, and help us shape the path of the kings.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4138420?t=1773086120","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4138420?t=1773086120","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138420/1eadefc7bf75f9564a6a4d93b6d7fa371a6e8fa0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773086120","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138420/1eadefc7bf75f9564a6a4d93b6d7fa371a6e8fa0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773086120","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Every dawn, the kingdom rises and every dusk, it falls again. In Kingspath, you take the role of a weary king trying to rebuild his realm from the ashes. Each day brings new chances to grow stronger, but also new battles to survive.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"ano